{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/91d575ecae46a57dab3824943c7f292f.poster.avif?t=1766729844\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/91d575ecae46a57dab3824943c7f292f.webm?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/91d575ecae46a57dab3824943c7f292f.mp4?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small food delivery robot with a simple task \u2014 to bring an order to its destination. But the journey becomes much more than just a delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/915b9144f46f7eb8b03f72b956d77a57.poster.avif?t=1766729844\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/915b9144f46f7eb8b03f72b956d77a57.webm?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/915b9144f46f7eb8b03f72b956d77a57.mp4?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through a charming neighborhood, weave through alleys and parks, and experience the everyday lives of the people around you. Children might invite you to bike races, an old man needs help getting an apple from a tree, and a stray cat may just hitch a ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/be95bbc3bacc1398ec41903a77af212f.poster.avif?t=1766729844\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/be95bbc3bacc1398ec41903a77af212f.webm?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/be95bbc3bacc1398ec41903a77af212f.mp4?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Delivery is a short, heartfelt adventure filled with little stories \u2014 some joyful, some bittersweet. You\u2019ll find hidden secrets, spontaneous moments, and gentle reminders of life\u2019s quiet beauty.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812830?t=1766729844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/1e8b440f5a5292a99e756da321ebbc0662b1c990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766729844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/f12a454f37e9bb829d8b612e49e17dc98832e619/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766729844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/f12a454f37e9bb829d8b612e49e17dc98832e619/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766729844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/91d575ecae46a57dab3824943c7f292f.poster.avif?t=1766729844\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/91d575ecae46a57dab3824943c7f292f.webm?t=1766729844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs